{
  "$comment": "Campaign level 45, the chapter 4 finale (The Wild Heart). A broad continent on a 256 map (lowland 34 above sea). A great volcano cone fills the centre (r 62, peak 360, vent off) around a flat summit caldera floor (disc r 14 at 118, the smoking vent) where a dormant Shaper only totem (the summit shrine, 40 s prayer, teaches Volcano and gives one charge) stands 6 cells from the crater; an old lava breach (ridge at 118) runs from the caldera to the south western flank. Shape rewards stop at 120 above sea, so the summit eruptions land on that caldera floor and a settle disc (r 10, falloff 0) restores it exactly 45 s after each one; the ley terrace on the lower south eastern slope (disc r 11 at 116) is settled the same way. Three rivals ring the mountain on cliff walled heights (falloff 1, 62 to 66 above the lowland), each sealed until its stage raises a ramp (a line shape): the raiders (tribe 2, sneaky) north east, ramp on their south west face; the warlike tribe (tribe 1, aggressive, hard) west, ramp on the north face of its scarp; the walled tribe (tribe 3, turtle, hard) south east, ramp on its southern face. Stages: grow to 40 followers while raider scouts (4 wardens) come from 300 s every 140 s (the idle loss near tick 9500); kill 12 raiders as two prongs come every 120 s; the north eastern ramp rises with a garrison and a last war band, burn the raiders Hearth while warlike probes hit the village every 180 s; the ley stone wakes (6 worshippers, 40 s), eruptions beside it every 120 s and walled priests every 110 s; the shrine wakes with 4 wolves 4 cells from it while the summit erupts every 150 s (from stage 1 on); the northern ramp rises with a 14 warden garrison and a war band, quakes split the west road and the path north; the southern ramp rises with a 16 warden garrison and a war band, quakes split the south road and the land below the southern cliff; break every tribe. Every repeating hazard and raid is warned 10 s ahead and bounded by until. Measured with the hard aggressive bot at offset 0: stages done near ticks 8750, 12500, 18500, 24000, 28250, 33750 and the win near 39450 (offsets 1 to 3 win near 35500, 38500 to 39000 and 38500 to 39000). Time limit 4200 s (84000 ticks).",
